			<div class="content"><blockquote><div><cite>andytalaga1 wrote:</cite>I mean it’s a stickied thread.  It’s not like it’s going off of the front page.  <img src="https://emoji.tapatalk-cdn.com/emoji2369.png" class="postimage" alt="Image"> Is there somewhere better to ask this question then in the thread that is already dedicated to the legacy v sets?  If there is Please direct me to it.</div></blockquote>
You are all good, friend. I read forum on tapatalk app, which just stacks unread posts all in one place (it lists the sub forum but I usually don’t notice it), which muddled things for me in this case. (Hope someone can answer your question too.)</div>

			
			
									
							
