		<div class="postbody">
						<div id="post_content1375528">

					<h3>
						<a href="./viewtopic.php?p=1375528&amp;sid=082382ffdbda6450a0ab9ab4a5c7e10a#p1375528">Re: Original 17 VSet PDFs for reference</a>
		</h3>

													<ul class="post-buttons">
																																									<li>
							<a href="./posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=1375528&amp;sid=082382ffdbda6450a0ab9ab4a5c7e10a" title="Reply with quote" class="button button-icon-only">
								<i class="icon fa-quote-left fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="sr-only">Quote</span>
							</a>
						</li>
														<li class="responsive-menu hidden dropdown-container"><a href="javascript:void(0);" class="js-responsive-menu-link responsive-menu-link dropdown-toggle"><i class="icon fa-bars fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i></a><div class="dropdown"><div class="pointer"><div class="pointer-inner"></div></div><ul class="dropdown-contents"></ul></div></li></ul>
							
						<p class="author">
									<a class="unread" href="./viewtopic.php?p=1375528&amp;sid=082382ffdbda6450a0ab9ab4a5c7e10a#p1375528" title="Post">
						<i class="icon fa-file fa-fw icon-lightgray icon-md" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="sr-only">Post</span>
					</a>
								<span class="responsive-hide">by <strong><a href="./memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=2595&amp;sid=082382ffdbda6450a0ab9ab4a5c7e10a" class="username">Throdo</a></strong> » </span><time datetime="2022-04-26T20:44:44+00:00">April 26th, 2022, 4:44 pm</time>
			</p>
			
			
			
			
			<div class="content">I updated the original 2 posts in this to include the original virtual sets.  Originally when I made this thread it wasn't allowed for me to upload them and I had to host them offsite.  At some point, the link to where they were hosted stopped working, but now they are back here for anyone who wants to download them!</div>

			
			
									
							
							<div id="sig1375528" class="signature"><a href="https://forum.starwarsccg.org/viewforum.php?f=1186" class="postlink">Atlanta League</a> Tournament Director<br>
<a href="https://forum.starwarsccg.org/viewtopic.php?p=1408420#p1408420" class="postlink">My Cube Series</a>: Beginner, Intermediate, and Advanced Cubes<br>
<a href="https://forum.starwarsccg.org/viewtopic.php?f=87&amp;t=62102" class="postlink">Original 17 vsets</a></div>			
						</div>

		</div>

				<div class="back2top">
