						<p class="author">
									<a class="unread" href="./viewtopic.php?p=1376589&amp;sid=082382ffdbda6450a0ab9ab4a5c7e10a#p1376589" title="Post">
						<i class="icon fa-file fa-fw icon-lightgray icon-md" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="sr-only">Post</span>
					</a>
								<span class="responsive-hide">by <strong><a href="./memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=181&amp;sid=082382ffdbda6450a0ab9ab4a5c7e10a" style="color: #AA0000;" class="username-coloured">Gergall</a></strong> » </span><time datetime="2022-05-11T22:03:23+00:00">May 11th, 2022, 6:03 pm</time>
			</p>
			
			
			
			
			<div class="content">Thanks for these great files Throdo!  The virtual slips page is now updated with all the PDFs.<br>
<br>
<a href="https://www.starwarsccg.org/resources/virtual-slips/" class="postlink">https://www.starwarsccg.org/resources/virtual-slips/</a><br>
<br>
Looking to always have the latest version of each PDF, so for 6.1 the newer one (with Rebel Fleet (V) banned) is used on that page.  If anyone knows of any legacy PDF on the page which is outdated, and has a later version of it, I'll be happy to swap in the later edition.</div>

			
			
									
							
							<div id="sig1376589" class="signature">Greg Zinn<br>
<img src="https://res.starwarsccg.org/badges/Rules.jpg" class="postimage" alt="Image"></div>			
						</div>

		</div>

